def: "An intrinsic cardiomyopathy characterized by hypokinetic, non-dilated, fibrotic or fibrofatty left ventricular myocardium and ventricular arrhythmias with a right bundle branch block pattern, with limited to no involvement of the right ventricle." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31637441/]
