[Term]
id: DOID:0070535
name: arrhythmogenic biventricular cardiomyopathy
def: "An intrinsic cardiomyopathy characterized by hypokinetic, non-dilated, fibrotic or fibrofatty replacement in both the left and right ventricular myocardium, with ventricular arrhythmias with left and right bundle branch block patterns." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/31637441/]
