name: developmental delay with sleep apnea
def: "An autosomal dominant intellectual developmental disorder characterized by hypotonia, global developmental delay, central and/or obstructive sleep apnea, and feeding difficulties that has_material_basis_in heterozygous mutation in the KCNK3 gene on chromosome 2p23." [url:https\://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC9534757/]
