[Term]
id: DOID:0070778
name: hormone receptor-negative/HER2-positive breast cancer
def: "A HER2 positive breast cancer characterized by excess HER2 (ERBB2) protein and the absence of both the estrogen and progesterone receptors." [url:https\://seer.cancer.gov/statfacts/html/breast-subtypes.html, url:https\://www.breastcancer.org/types/molecular-subtypes, url:https\://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/breast-cancer/understanding-a-breast-cancer-diagnosis/breast-cancer-her2-status.html, url:https\://www.cancer.org/cancer/types/breast-cancer/understanding-a-breast-cancer-diagnosis/breast-cancer-hormone-receptor-status.html]
