def: "A syndrome characterized by early-onset respiratory distress, chronic hypoxemia, diffuse parenchymal lung abnormalities on chest imaging, and developmental delay, with speech and language development more severely affected, that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutations in the TMEM63B gene on chromosome 6p21." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/42259295/]
