def: "A panniculitis that is characterized by sudden onset of painful, erythematous, subcutaneous nodules mainly localized to the pretibial areas. Lesions are usually bilateral and symmetrical, ranging from 1 to 5 cm in diameter." [url:https\://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erythema_nodosum, url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/30269303/]
