def: "A combined immunodeficiency characterized by onset of recurrent infection in early childhood, impaired neutrophil chemotaxis, decreased B cells, hypogammaglobulinemia, and other variable features that has_material_basis_in homozygous or compound heterozygous mutation in the RAC2 gene on chromosome 22q12." [url:https\://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/25512081/]
synonym: "IMD73C" EXACT OMO:0003012 []
